        "description": "<p class=\"\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"389\">Communities in arid zones are struggling with water scarcity as demand often outpaces supply. You&rsquo;ve been asked by the Water Sustainability Alliance to pinpoint areas where per-person usage spikes far above the norm. By comparing each community&rsquo;s monthly water consumption to the regional average, you&rsquo;ll identify critical hotspots and their worst month for targeted conservation measures.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"449\">You are given two tables: &lsquo;communities&rsquo; and &lsquo;water_usage&rsquo;.</p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"582\">The &lsquo;communities&rsquo; table contains &lsquo;community_id&rsquo;, &lsquo;name&rsquo;, and &lsquo;population&rsquo;. Each row identifies a settlement and its population.</li>\n<li data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"741\">The &lsquo;water_usage&rsquo; table contains &lsquo;usage_id&rsquo;, &lsquo;community_id&rsquo;, &lsquo;month&rsquo;, and &lsquo;liters_used&rsquo;. Each row logs total water consumed by a community in a given month.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"759\">Your task is to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"831\">Compute each community&rsquo;s per_capita_usage = liters_used &divide; population.</li>\n<li data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"911\">Determine the average per_capita_usage across all communities for that month.</li>\n<li data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"1010\">Select months where a community&rsquo;s per_capita_usage exceeds the monthly average by more than 20%.</li>\n<li data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1096\">For each selected community, report the month in which its per_capita_usage peaked.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1235\">The output columns should be &lsquo;name&rsquo;, &lsquo;month&rsquo;, and &lsquo;per_capita_usage&rsquo;, ordered by &lsquo;per_capita_usage&rsquo; descending, then by &lsquo;name&rsquo; ascending.</p>",
        "schema": "CREATE TABLE communities (\n  community_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  name VARCHAR(100),\n  population INT\n);\nCREATE TABLE water_usage (\n  usage_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  community_id INT,\n  month VARCHAR(7),\n  liters_used INT\n);\nINSERT INTO communities VALUES\n  (101, 'Mirage Town', 600),\n  (102, 'Heatwave City', 1200),\n  (103, 'Cactus Plains', 350),\n  (104, 'Oasis Point', 700),\n  (105, 'Sunset Ridge', 450);\nINSERT INTO water_usage VALUES\n  (101, 101, '2025-03', 140000),\n  (102, 102, '2025-03', 200000),\n  (103, 103, '2025-03', 95000),\n  (104, 104, '2025-03', 160000),\n  (105, 105, '2025-03', 90000),\n  (106, 101, '2025-04', 135000),\n  (107, 102, '2025-04', 195000),\n  (108, 103, '2025-04', 98000),\n  (109, 104, '2025-04', 158000),\n  (110, 105, '2025-04', 92000);",
